The function btmtk_usb_hci_wmt_sync() directly casts the SKB data pointer to struct types (btmtk_hci_wmt_evt and btmtk_hci_wmt_evt_funcc) without verifying that the SKB contains sufficient data. A short firmware response leads to out-of-bounds reads from SKB tailroom.

